<title>USA: Exsorbet Industries buys 7-7.</title>
<headline>Exsorbet Industries buys 7-7.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exsorbet Industries Inc said it acquired 7-7 Inc, a Wooster, Ohio-based company that provides specialized environmental services .</p>
<p>Under the terms of the deal, all of the outstanding shares of the company were purchased through an undisclosed combination of cash and Exsorbet common stock.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
